        "@value": "TVB Productions ICONS"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "One Stage. Five ICONS. One Unforgettable Night! Get ready to experience ICONS – a spectacular live concert event celebrating the unforgettable music of five of the most legendary voices of all time for one incredible night! Experience the magic of Elvis Presley, Roy Orbison, Frankie Valli, Neil Diamond, and Johnny Cash like never before –&hellip;"
      },
      {
