    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "We just made history… and now it’s your turn. The Magic Men Australia “Larger than life” WORLD TOUR is storming into town for ONE UNFORGETTABLE NIGHT — and trust us, you do not want to miss what everyone will be talking about! Fresh off BREAKING A WORLD RECORD in Scandinavia for the largest ladies’ night&hellip;"
