      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Forever Simon &amp; Garfunkel: A Tribute celebrates the best-selling duo in rock’n’roll history. With humor, soaring energy, charm, and laser precise harmony, Sean Altman &amp; Jack Skuller lead the audience on a concert&hellip;"
